        "ActionParameters": [
          {
            "Id": 2614,
            "GlobalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
            "ActionId": 567,
            "Name": "Notes",
            "Value": "<p>Monitors the <strong>dbo.DnnSharp_SharpScheduler_History</strong> table for excessive growth.</p>\n<p>Plant an App records the execution history of automation jobs in the <strong>dbo.DnnSharp_SharpScheduler_History</strong> table. Because history records are not removed automatically, the table will continue to grow unless a periodic cleanup process is implemented.</p>\n<p>The workflow evaluates both the total number of history records and the age of the oldest history entry. An alert is generated when either of the following thresholds is exceeded:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Warning</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>More than <strong>100,000</strong> history records, or</li>\n<li>Oldest history record is more than <strong>90 days</strong> old.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Medium</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>More than <strong>1,000,000</strong> history records, or</li>\n<li>Oldest history record is more than <strong>365 days</strong> old.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The alert includes the current record count, the oldest and newest history dates, and the age of each in days.</p>\n<p>This alert is intended to identify systems that would benefit from implementing or increasing the frequency of automation history cleanup. While a large history table is not typically an immediate operational problem, continued growth increases database size and can gradually impact backup times, maintenance operations, and overall database performance. A common retention strategy is to keep approximately 30 days of automation history, although appropriate retention periods vary by environment and auditing requirements. An example history cleanup automation is available on Campfire.</p>",
            "ActionStackId": null,
            "ParentParameterId": null,
            "IsExpression": false,
            "OrderIndex": 0,
            "LastModified": "0001-01-01T00:00:00+00:00",
            "LastModifiedBy": null
          }
        ],
        "Parameters": {},
        "Metadata": {},
        "HasActionParameters": false
      },
